<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Huntco cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Huntco cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it reduced its rating on Huntco Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said in a research note that near-term margin pressure should halt the company's current earnings momentum while long-term trends in earnings and volume remain positive.</p>
</text>
